| `edminboost-presets-page.php` | Presets & role matrix |
| `edminboost-behavior-page.php` | Behavior & style controls |

Use `fieldset` + `legend` for grouped settings; label every input; `screen-reader-text` for icon-only controls.

## Mapper JS (`initMapper`)

Key elements: `#edminboost-mapper-form`, `#edminboost-topbar-items`, `#edminboost-topbar-canvas`, `#edminboost-discovered-list`, `#edminboost-topbar-hidden-inputs`, `#edminboost-item-drawer`, `#edminboost-plugin-search`, `#edminboost-drawer-preview`, `#edminboost-drawer-preview-wrap`.

- Canvas items: drag-reorder within canvas (`dragItem`, `effectAllowed: move`); keyed by `data-slug` + `data-anchor`.
- Discovered rows: drag-to-canvas (`dragPayload`, `effectAllowed: copy`); checkbox and row-click toggle add/remove (skipped when anchor is set).
- `setDiscoveredChecked()` keeps discovered `is-active` in sync with canvas membership for non-anchored slugs only.
- `syncHiddenInputs()` writes indexed hidden fields for `top_bar_items` (including `anchor`) before form submit.
- Custom link fields: `#edminboost-custom-link-path`, `#edminboost-custom-link-label`, `#edminboost-custom-link-anchor`; path may include `#fragment`.
- Item drawer field: `#edminboost-item-anchor`; preview button `#edminboost-drawer-preview` POSTs to `edminboost_cc_drawer_preview`, then calls `edminboostCcOpenDrawer`.
- Hidden marker input: `command_center[_layout_studio_save]` = `1` (Layout Studio partial only).
- Plugin search (`#edminboost-plugin-search`): filters discovered rows by visible label text.

## Enqueuing

| Handle | File | When |
|--------|------|------|
| `edminboost-admin` | `admin/js/edminboost-admin.js`, `admin/css/edminboost-admin.css` | Plugin screens (`EDMINBOOST_Admin::is_plugin_screen()`) |
| `edminboost-command-center-bar` (style) | `admin/css/edminboost-command-center-bar.css` | CC bar active or Layout Studio (`is_mapper_screen()`) |
| `edminboost-command-center-bar` (script) | `admin/js/edminboost-command-center-bar.js` | `has_drawer_items()` or Layout Studio |

Version: `EDMINBOOST_VERSION` for all handles.
